<section class="about-hero">
  <h1>A Government Working in the Open</h1>
  <p class="about-lede">
    The UDF Government of Kerala is committed to transparent, accountable governance —
    and to making sure every Keralite can see exactly what their government is doing for them.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="about-section">
  <div class="about-section-inner">
    <h2>Who We Are</h2>
    <p>
      The United Democratic Front (UDF) is Kerala's oldest and largest political coalition,
      led by the Indian National Congress together with its allies. Since taking office on
      18 May 2026, the Satheesan Ministry — led by Chief Minister V. D. Satheesan — has been
      entrusted with governing Kerala on a mandate of good governance, welfare, and development
      for all.
    </p>
    <p class="about-cta"><a href="/ministers/">Meet the full Council of Ministers &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

